- drift: every launch halted — the epic's launch record names 'ghost', which the manifest no longer has — run /flow-epic-run reconcile-drift (window manage-my-epic)
- drift: alpha — alpha was launched as 'alpha-old', but that pipeline no longer exists — run /flow-epic-run reconcile-drift (window manage-my-epic)
- drift: beta — a merged PR #9 is on branch 'beta' — run /flow-epic-run reconcile-drift (window manage-my-epic)

